q q 1 0 0 1 60 692 cm .105882 .262745 .196078 rg BT 22 TL/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (5. Machine Learning Methodology)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 60 679 cm .105882 .262745 .196078 RG 1 J 0 0 m 492 0 l S Q q 1 0 0 1 60 641 cm .176471 .215686 .282353 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 18.5 Tm (The application leverages a two-phase machine learning pipeline combining supervised classification and)Tj T* (unsupervised clustering to provide robust agronomic insights.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 60 611 cm .25098 .568627 .423529 rg BT 16 TL/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Outlier Mitigation & IQR)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 60 561 cm .176471 .215686 .282353 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 32.5 Tm (To ensure high generalization, outliers are removed from the Phosphorous column in the training dataset. The)Tj T* (Interquartile Range \(IQR\) method calculates Q1 \(25th percentile\) and Q3 \(75th percentile\). Data points falling outside)Tj T* (1.5 times the IQR range are scrubbed, ensuring the model's coefficients are not skewed.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 60 531 cm .25098 .568627 .423529 rg BT 16 TL/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Supervised Classification: Logistic Regression)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 60 481 cm .176471 .215686 .282353 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 32.5 Tm (Using the preprocessed 7 features, a multi-class Logistic Regression classifier is trained. Using an 80/20 train-test)Tj T* (split, the classifier achieves a cross-validated prediction accuracy of )Tj/F2 9.5 Tf (94.0%)Tj/F1 9.5 Tf ( across the 22 crops. The trained model)Tj T* (state is exported to )Tj/F3 9.5 Tf (model.pkl)Tj/F1 9.5 Tf (.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 60 451 cm .25098 .568627 .423529 rg BT 16 TL/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (Unsupervised Clustering: K-Means Clustering)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 60 387 cm .176471 .215686 .282353 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm (To discover soil parameter boundaries without labeled target outputs, the system fits a K-Means model \(K=4\). This)Tj T* (identifies general chemical environments \(e.g. high-nitrogen/low-rain